    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">assessĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ads-</span></b> ), ōnis, f.
